// Country screening, three tiers:
//  1. BLOCK  - comprehensive-embargo countries (and regions) where the person lives / connects from, plus the owner's own list
//  2. REVIEW - nationality / birth country / phone prefix of an embargoed country, or a country on the review list: the account is
//              opened but stays "pending" and staff look at it by hand (dual nationals, expats and ex-residents are not turned away)
